Kottos has zero third-party runtime dependencies — it is a self-contained C++20
artifact. The only fetched dependency is GoogleTest (BSD-3-Clause), pulled in at
build time for the test suite only; it is never linked into the gateway and
imposes no obligations on downstream users of the runtime.
